Package: biomassrecovery
Title: Report Tropical Forest Biomass Recovery Trajectories at the Ecoregion Scale
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tessa", "Forth", , "fortht@mcmaster.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package reads a table of unfiltered data for tropical forest ecoregions' biomass in primary forests and linear regression parameters measured across different ages of forests regrowing from stand-replacing disturbance. It filters the dataset to the most relevant and viable records, then calculates additional reporting fields that depict timelines and progress of biomass recovery.
